and the maximum drawdown over the evaluation
period is
MDD = min
1≤t≤T DDt.
An MDD value closer to zero indicates better
downside risk control and capital preservation
C.4
Cumulative Return (CR)
Cumulative Return measures the total excess return
of the strategy over the entire investment horizon.
It is defined as
CR =
