Hypothesis & Formula Consistency
Filter
Stage 2 is intended to test whether a candidate for-
mula measures the OHLCV-observable condition
stated in its originating hypothesis. It is not de-
signed as a standalone alpha, IC, or RankIC filter.
We therefore examine its strategy-level contribution
separately from the marginal predictive association
of individual formulas.
